  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCOC Poultry Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to increase revenues of HCOC through increased production and sales of chicken from current 22000 to 100,000 broilers per year by 2021. The project will establish more butchery at strategic points, in Murewa and elsewhere. The project will increase supplies of chicken to butcheries in the market.</narrative>
  </description>
